  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHp/1251",
  "contentHtml": "<br>저항의&nbsp;연결과&nbsp;옴의&nbsp;법칙을&nbsp;수업을&nbsp;하고&nbsp;난&nbsp;뒤에<br>학생이&nbsp;전구를&nbsp;직렬과&nbsp;병렬로&nbsp;연결할때&nbsp;밝기가&nbsp;어떻게&nbsp;되는지&nbsp;수업시간에&nbsp;물어보았습니다.&nbsp;<br>이&nbsp;질문이&nbsp;나오면&nbsp;어떻게&nbsp;할까&nbsp;고민을&nbsp;했던터라&nbsp;미리&nbsp;준비를&nbsp;했던&nbsp;자료를&nbsp;이용했습니다.&nbsp;<br><br><br>준비물&nbsp;:&nbsp;건전지3개,&nbsp;같은&nbsp;전구2개&nbsp;&nbsp;(전류계,&nbsp;도선)<br>수업은&nbsp;이론을&nbsp;통해서&nbsp;예측을&nbsp;해보는&nbsp;단계와<br>예측을&nbsp;실험을&nbsp;통해서&nbsp;확인하는&nbsp;단계로&nbsp;나누어서&nbsp;진행했습니다&nbsp;.<br><br><br>일단&nbsp;이론을&nbsp;통해서&nbsp;예측을&nbsp;해보는&nbsp;단계는&nbsp;아래그림과&nbsp;같이&nbsp;저항과&nbsp;전압값을&nbsp;가정하고&nbsp;전류값을&nbsp;학생들과&nbsp;계산해봄으로써&nbsp;<br>밝기를&nbsp;예측해보았습니다.&nbsp;<br><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/260CAF3C57187B992F\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"580\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"580\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"크기변환_전구밝기.jpg\" id=\"A_260CAF3C57187B992F0806\"></p><p>밝기비교는&nbsp;위의&nbsp;내용처럼&nbsp;나왔습니다.&nbsp;<br><br>그리고&nbsp;실제 밝기비교를&nbsp;해보았습니다.&nbsp;<br>동영상은&nbsp;제가&nbsp;책상에서&nbsp;간단하게&nbsp;해본&nbsp;결과이고,&nbsp;수업시간에는&nbsp;학생들에게&nbsp;간단하게&nbsp;전지와&nbsp;전구를&nbsp;나누어주고&nbsp;실험해보게&nbsp;하였습니다.&nbsp;<br></p><p><iframe id=\"vee96Fo33F1ySuVVdkjduYk\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/vee96Fo33F1ySuVVdkjduYk?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InZlZTk2Rm8zM0YxeVN1VlZka2pkdVlrIiwidGlkIjoiMzQ4YzIzOTAtNzg5NC00NzM1LWE3ZWUtMGY4MGY0MjY3ZDFiIiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTgyMDQxfQ.tUp2OhAwtbXTYCpBvt6hvBXe1B28QhEoOGgH40MbdDHk6p7i7RAjRaLu9qX77ofvju6ZMfd27xeP0_S1LEYIVQ&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p><p><br><br><br>[후기]<br>단순한&nbsp;질문에서&nbsp;시작한&nbsp;수업진행이었지만&nbsp;<br>과학을&nbsp;설명하는&nbsp;방법이&nbsp;법칙에&nbsp;의해&nbsp;이론적으로&nbsp;계산으로&nbsp;하는&nbsp;방법도&nbsp;있고<br>이러한&nbsp;예측을&nbsp;직접&nbsp;실험을&nbsp;통하여&nbsp;증명하는&nbsp;과정이&nbsp;있음을&nbsp;아이들과&nbsp;나눌&nbsp;수&nbsp;있었습니다.&nbsp;<br>전류값을&nbsp;측정해보고&nbsp;싶다는&nbsp;학생들이&nbsp;있어서&nbsp;전류계와&nbsp;도선을&nbsp;주고&nbsp;측정해보게&nbsp;하였습니다.<br><br>더불어&nbsp;전구에&nbsp;적혀있는&nbsp;정격전압,&nbsp;정격전류에&nbsp;대한&nbsp;이야기도&nbsp;해주었습니다.&nbsp;<br><br><br><br><br><br><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
